# JT-80x0's factory clips: two tracks, LOWER the bass, UPPER the melody, as the FM-1 plays them.
#   python3 tools/demo/demo.py tools/demo/clips.demo        -> build/demo/clips.mp4
# Needs firmware/gen/mv_fclips_local.h (the factory clips: git-ignored, third-party transcriptions).
# Clip F<n> is CLIP 12 + n on SEQ 3/3 (after the 12 user clips). A program change leaves SPLIT, so each song
# sets it again; a program is one sound for both parts (its LOWER patch is its UPPER until one is saved).
# turn ... 0: a jump in one pass (exact on JT-80x0; a quick hand turn steps x4).

name   JT-80x0
theme  amber
footer Rendered by the JT-80x0 firmware itself (tests/host.c): screen and sound as the engine makes them  ·  github.com/bk40-home/M-vance  ·  Clips: transcriptions, for demonstration

0     title JT-80x0 | The sequencer: two tracks of factory clips

# ---- Robert Miles: Children ----
4     caption Robert Miles: Children | Piano and bass: factory clips F32 (UPPER) and F35 (LOWER)
+0    pc 2
+0.2  press GLO                             # PLAY MODE 1/2, 2/2, then PERFORM 1/2
+0.1  press GLO
+0.1  press GLO
+0.1  turn KNOB1 2 0                        # MODE SINGLE -> SPLIT
+0.1  press HOME
+0.1  hold OCT- 0.3                         # PART SELECT: OCT- held, OCT+: LOWER
+0.1  press OCT+
+0.3  press OCT-                            # (the octave step undone)
+0.1  press SEQ                             # SEQ 1/3, 2/3, 3/3: the clips
+0.1  press SEQ
+0.1  press SEQ
+0.1  turn KNOB1 46 0                       # CLIP F35
+0.1  turn KNOB4 -1 0                       # MODE LOAD
+0.1  press SAVE                            # -> LOWER
+0.4  hold OCT+ 0.3                         # PART SELECT: OCT+ held, OCT-: UPPER
+0.1  press OCT-
+0.3  press OCT+                            # (the octave step undone)
+0.1  turn KNOB1 -3 0                       # CLIP F32
+0.1  press SAVE                            # -> UPPER
+0.1  turn SELECT 17 0                      # TEMPO 137
+0.3  press PLAY                            # 8 bars
+0.3  press SEQ                             # SEQ 1/3: both tracks and their playheads
+6.71 press SEQ                             # SEQ 2/3: the piano roll
+7.00 press PLAY

